2012 is a action, adventure, science fiction film directed by Roland Emmerich.

3
00:20:36,521 --> 00:20:42,521
Adrian Helmsley, part of a worldwide geophysical team investigating the effect on the earth of
radiation from unprecedented solar storms, learns that the earth's core is heating up.

4
00:27:28,695 --> 00:27:34,695
He warns U.S.

5
00:34:20,869 --> 00:34:26,869
President Thomas Wilson that the crust of the earth is becoming unstable and that without proper
preparations for saving a fraction of the world's population, the entire race is doomed.

6
00:41:13,043 --> 00:41:19,043
Meanwhile, writer Jackson Curtis stumbles on the same information.

7
00:48:05,217 --> 00:48:11,217
While the world's leaders race to build "arks" to escape the impending
cataclysm, Curtis struggles to find a way to save his family.

8
